*> T28200 (lane 002-lane-p70d): the client's use-item state that drives the first-person arm poses of 12 section 6.6 (17 sections 3.6, 3.9, 3.10). USE-ITEM-CLASS names the use animation of
*> an item by its key (bow, crossbow, trident, shield); USE-ITEM-AMMO tells a projectile (a creative player has infinite materials; the tag arrows; a firework rocket only for a crossbow);
*> STACK-CHARGED reads charged_projectiles (51) of a stack into PL-SLOT-CHARGED and PL-OFFHAND-CHARGED (MENU-PLAYER-SET, MENU-STACK-PUT); USE-ITEM-INPUT begins the use on the
*> right button (Use Item with the hand that uses, the use state kept) and ends it with Player Action 6; HAND-MESH poses the using hand: the mesh of a bow, crossbow or trident in use,
*> an auto spin attack and a loaded crossbow equals the mesh HAND-BUILD makes for the pose kind of HAND-ARM (whose matrices test_hand_pose checks), and differs from the hand at rest.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-USE-ITEM.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 COPY CLCONST.
 COPY CCSHIM.
 COPY CONTENT.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY TESTLIB.
